      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il décrit des cercles dans le ciel en faisant pleuvoir des écailles enflammées. Il était jadis surnommé « le courroux solaire ».",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "As it flies, it scatters its flaming scales. It was feared by ancient people, who referred to it as “the rage of the sun.”",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "炎の　鱗粉を　振りまきながら 飛びまわる。　古代の　人々は 太陽の怒りと　呼び　恐れた。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Selon la légende, il serait né d’un cocon de flammes et serait venu à la rescousse des humains et des Pokémon souffrant du froid.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "According to legends, it was hatched from a flaming cocoon to save people and Pokémon that were suffering from the cold.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "燃え盛る　炎の繭から　生まれ 寒さに　苦しむ人や　ポケモンを 救ったという　伝説が　ある。　",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Certains disent qu’il répand ses écailles ardentes pour provoquer des incendies, d’autres, pour sauver ceux qui souffrent du froid.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Volcarona scatters burning scales. Some say it does this to start fires. Others say it’s trying to rescue those that suffer in the cold.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "炎の　りんぷんを　振りまき 火事を　起こすとも　寒さに 苦しむものを　救うとも　いう。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Né d’un cocon enflammé, ce Pokémon apparaît sur d’anciennes fresques représenté comme une divinité du feu.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "This Pokémon emerges from a cocoon formed of raging flames. Ancient murals depict Volcarona as a deity of fire.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "燃えさかる　炎の　繭から 生まれる。　古代の　壁画に 炎の神として　描かれている。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
